 Glob or Grep directly]\\n</example>\\n<example>\\nuser: What is the codebase structure?\\nassistant: [Uses the Task tool]\\n</example>\\n\\nIMPORTANT: Always use the TodoWrite tool to plan and track tasks throughout the conversation.\\n\\n# Code References\\n\\nWhen referencing specific functions or pieces of code include the pattern `file_path:line_number` to allow the user to easily navigate to the source code location.\\n\\n<example>\\nuser: Where are errors from the client handled?\\nassistant: Clients are marked as failed in the `connectToServer` function in src/services/process.ts:712.\\n</example>\\n\"},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"Here is some useful information about the environment you are running in:\\n<env>\\n  Working directory: /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1791368974521\\n  Is directory a git repo: yes\\n  Platform: linux\\n  Today's date: Wed Oct 07 2026\\n</env>\\n\\n<files>\\n  .changeset/\\n\\tconfig.json\\n\\tissue-2563-held-back-merge-log.md\\n\\tquiet-pr-description.md\\n\\tREADME.md\\n.github/\\n\\tactions/\\n\\t\\t[3 truncated]\\n\\tcodeql/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\tworkflows/\\n\\t\\t[8 truncated]\\n\\tdependabot.yml\\n\\tzizmor.yml\\n.husky/\\n\\tpre-commit\\ncase-studies/\\n\\tissue-661-session-resume-cost-optimization/\\n\\t\\t[3 truncated]\\ncoolify/\\n\\t.dockerignore\\n\\t.env.example\\n\\tdocker-compose.yml\\n\\tDockerfile\\n\\tREADME.md\\n\\tstart.sh\\ndata/\\n\\tcase-studies/\\n\\t\\t[2 truncated]\\ndev/\\n\\tlog/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\ndocs/\\n\\tcase-studies/\\n\\t\\t[556 truncated]\\n\\tdependencies-research/\\n\\t\\t[7 truncated]\\n\\tBEST-PRACTICES.hi.md\\n\\tBEST-PRACTICES.md\\n\\tBEST-PRACTICES.ru.md\\n\\tBEST-PRACTICES.zh.md\\n\\tBRANCH_PROTECTION_POLICY.hi.md\\n\\tBRANCH_PROTECTION_POLICY.md\\n\\tBRANCH_PROTECTION_POLICY.ru.md\\n\\tBRANCH_PROTECTION_POLICY.zh.md\\n\\tCI-CD-BEST-PRACTICES.hi.md\\n\\tCI-CD-BEST-PRACTICES.md\\n\\tCI-CD-BEST-PRACTICES.ru.md\\n\\tCI-CD-BEST-PRACTICES.zh.md\\n\\tCOLLECTING-LOGS.hi.md\\n\\tCOLLECT